        "original_id": "6ac1faf5-8003-5b28-b899-b2e893feae54",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Scott Michael Smith, Margaret Atwood, Reed Morano, Kristin Gore, Dave Eggar, Chuck Palmer, Amy Lee\n- Works: The Handmaid's Tale, War Story\n- Organizations: Hulu\n- Topics: music mixing, directing, screenplay, music, cinematography, novel adaptation, awards\n\nFacts:\n- Margaret Atwood wrote The Handmaid's Tale as a dystopian novel in 1985.\n- Hulu released a 2017 television adaptation of Margaret Atwood's The Handmaid's Tale.\n- Reed Morano directed the first three episodes of Hulu's 2017 television adaptation of The Handmaid's Tale.\n- War Story is a 2014 film with a screenplay by Kristin Gore.\n- War Story has music by Dave Eggar, Chuck Palmer, and Amy Lee.\n- Reed Morano was the cinematographer for War Story.\n- Scott Michael Smith mixes the music for the Emmy Award-winning series The Handmaid's Tale.",
